也可以手动把包加入 profile 的 `bundles`。因为是以 link 方式安装，改完 `client.js` 刷新页面即可生效，无需重新安装。

@local/dsh-section README · 数据与边界：- 分组与归属关系保存在**浏览器 localStorage** 的键 `dsh-section.state.v1` 下（纯前端 UI 数据，不写入门户会话事件、不上传）；其中也存了每个会话的「已读到哪个时间」的标记，用于行尾状态点。「显示更多」的展开进度只存在内存里，刷新即回到第一页。
- 分组模式侧栏通过遮蔽宿主的 `sidebar.workspaces` 席位实现（`priority: -1`），因此宿主侧栏升级后可能需要跟随适配。
- 归档项目 = 调用宿主 workspace 的删除/移除，只影响侧栏列表。

@local/dsh-section README · inside a DSH session：plugin_manager action=install_bundle target=/absolute/path/dsh-section
```

You can also add the package to the profile `bundles` manually. It is installed as a link, so editing `client.js` and reloading the page is enough — no reinstall needed.

@local/dsh-section README · Data and boundaries：- Sections, assignments and per-session read marks live in **browser localStorage** under `dsh-section.state.v1` (pure front-end UI data — no session events are appended, nothing is uploaded). How far a group has been unfolded by *Show more* is in-memory only, so a reload starts at the first page.
- Section mode works by shadowing the host's `sidebar.workspaces` seat (`priority: -1`), so a future host sidebar change may need a follow-up adaptation.
- Archiving a project calls the host workspace removal and only affects the sidebar list.
